    "title": "Benchmark Hygiene Reveals the Non-Canonical Frontier of Peptide-MHC-I Binding Prediction",
    "description": "Systematic benchmark of six deep-learning architectures for peptide-MHC-I binding prediction, quantifying cutpoint sensitivity (a ~4-fold calibration offset between two high-fidelity predictors that rank peptides near-identically) and the non-canonical binding frontier.",
